# Default unit policy for the Homebrew package preinstall.
#
# ublue-os/brew's own 01-homebrew.preset (shipped via cosmic-deps/brew.bst
# system_files) already enables brew-setup.service + the update/upgrade
# timers. This preset adds our first-boot package preinstall on top.
#
# brew-preinstall.service runs `brew bundle install` against
# /usr/share/cosmic/homebrew/Brewfile after brew-setup.service has extracted
# Homebrew, as the primary user, once network is up. Idempotent across boots.
# Disable this (drop a higher-numbered preset with `disable
# brew-preinstall.service`) if you want Homebrew available but no packages
# auto-installed.
enable brew-preinstall.service
